OL,5,G0600 The Welsh Roots of Country
OL,6,     FWhen Al Lewis travelled to
OL,7,     FNashville in 2012 to record an
OL,8,     Falbum, he discovered that the
OL,9,     FWelsh have played a far greater
OL,10,     Frole in shaping country and
OL,11,     FAmericana music than many realise.
OL,12,G0630 Science Cafe
OL,13,     FAdam Walton explores extreme
OL,14,     Fweather and the effects of climate
OL,15,     Fchange in Wales.
OL,16,G0700 Country Focus
OL,17,     FProgramme for everyone living in
OL,18,     Fthe countryside and tackling the
OL,19,     Fissues affecting them.
