OL,8,     FCardiff looks at how Jesus built
OL,9,     FWales over twenty centuries
OL,10,     Fthrough his church.
OL,11,G0800 Sunday Supplement
OL,12,     FJennifer Jones with political
OL,13,     Fnews, discussions and analysis
OL,14,     Ffrom Wales, the UK and the world.
OL,15,G0900 All Things Considered
OL,16,     FTir Dewi, a Welsh charity
OL,17,     Fsupporting farmers, has been
OL,18,     Fnominated for the BBC 'Make a
OL,19,     FDifference' Awards. Rosa Hunt
OL,20,     Fexplores the challenges farmers
OL,21,     Fface and how Tir Dewi can help.
